From: canoziia <canoziia@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] glm5next: compiled sm_80 W4A16 Marlin MoE decode

VLLM_GLM5_MARLIN_DECODE_CUDA (default 0 = unchanged), _VARIANT (orig),
_TOKENS (4,8), _LIB. Loads and validates the _ampere_marlin_C library
(models/glm-5.3-flash/native/ampere_marlin; the DFlash2 image installs it as
vllm._ampere_marlin_C, so _LIB stays empty), hooks MarlinExperts.apply for
small decode batches, warms up and self-checks against fused_marlin_moe
before graph capture, and fails early in Worker.init_device when the flag
is on but the library is missing or mismatched. No silent fallback. Not
bitwise equal to Marlin.

